Sun Oct 18 10:56:46 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to 0.38.0:
  * OSH: implement GLOBIGNORE for better bash compatibility
  * OSH: implement shopt -u globskipdots
  * OSH: getopts supports leading colon for silent mode
  * OSH: exec -a sets argv[0], like bash
  * OSH: trap empty string now ignores signals (SIG_IGN)
  * umask accepts symbolic modes like ug=rwx
  * YSH: new Dict methods clear, append and update, plus ++
  * YSH: new io.glob() and io.libcGlob() functions
  * YSH: trap --ignore to ignore signals
  * Remove long-deprecated _status variable in YSH
  * kill -l handles more cases
  * Report core dumps with a message like other shells
- Use pkgconfig(history) and pkgconfig(readline) BuildRequires;
  %autosetup -p1

